{"translation-revision-date":"2025-02-05 09:17-0500","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.11.0","source":"dist\/js\/interface.LOAN.gpl.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"en":["fi"],"Please use the backspace key to delete.":["K\u00e4yt\u00e4 backspace-n\u00e4pp\u00e4int\u00e4 poistaaksesi."],"Left, up & down arrow keys are disabled. So are the home, end, pgup and pgdn keys.":["Vasen, yl\u00f6s- ja alanuolin\u00e4pp\u00e4imet ovat pois k\u00e4yt\u00f6st\u00e4. Sama koskee home, end, pgup ja pgdn -n\u00e4pp\u00e4imi\u00e4."],"Use backspace to delete.":["K\u00e4yt\u00e4 backspace-n\u00e4pp\u00e4int\u00e4 poistaaksesi."],"If value is selected, just start typing new value to clear prior value.":["Jos arvo on valittu, aloita uuden arvon kirjoittaminen tyhjent\u00e4\u00e4ksesi edellisen arvon."],"When a number is selected (value shown in inverse), use right arrow key to clear selection without clearing value. Then backspace to edit.":["Kun numero on valittu (arvo n\u00e4kyy k\u00e4\u00e4nteisen\u00e4), voit poistaa valinnan oikealla nuolin\u00e4pp\u00e4imell\u00e4 tyhjent\u00e4m\u00e4tt\u00e4 arvoa. Muokkaa sitten askelpalauttimella."],"TIP: Generally it is best to use the TAB or SHIFT-TAB keys to move from one input to the next or previous input.":["VINKKI: Yleens\u00e4 on parasta k\u00e4ytt\u00e4\u00e4 TAB- tai SHIFT-TAB-n\u00e4pp\u00e4imi\u00e4 siirty\u00e4ksesi yhdest\u00e4 sy\u00f6tteest\u00e4 seuraavaan tai edelliseen sy\u00f6tteeseen."],"TIP 2: Generally, editing a value is inefficient. Since values are auto selected, just type the number you want.":["VINKKI 2: Yleens\u00e4 arvon muokkaaminen on tehotonta. Koska arvot valitaan automaattisesti, kirjoita vain haluamasi luku."],"Do not type the thousand separator character.":["\u00c4l\u00e4 kirjoita tuhaterotusmerkki\u00e4."],"(If using U.S. convention, that would be the comma.)":["(Jos k\u00e4yt\u00f6ss\u00e4 on Yhdysvaltojen konventio, se olisi pilkku.)"],"I'm smart enough to enter them for you!":["Olen tarpeeksi fiksu sy\u00f6tt\u00e4m\u00e4\u00e4n ne puolestasi!"],"An unknown date calculation error occurred.":["Tapahtui tuntematon p\u00e4iv\u00e4m\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4n laskentavirhe."],"Please provide us with your inputs and settings so that we can fix this. Thank you.":["Ilmoita meille sy\u00f6tteesi ja asetuksesi, jotta voimme korjata t\u00e4m\u00e4n. Kiitos."],"Date is not valid - bad year.":["P\u00e4iv\u00e4m\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4 ei ole kelvollinen - virheellinen vuosi."],"Jan":["tammi"],"Feb":["helmi"],"Mar":["maalis"],"Apr":["huhti"],"May":["toukokuu"],"Jun":["kes\u00e4"],"Jul":["hein\u00e4"],"Aug":["elo"],"Sept":["syys"],"Oct":["loka"],"Nov":["marras"],"Dec":["joulu"],"Error: dates out of sequence.":["Virhe: p\u00e4iv\u00e4m\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4t eiv\u00e4t ole j\u00e4rjestyksess\u00e4."],"Exception":["Poikkeus"],"occurred when accessing":["tapahtui, kun k\u00e4ytettiin"],"Invalid index":["Virheellinen indeksi"],"Unknown":["Tuntematon"],"u":["t"],"U":["T"],"Internal limit reached. Balance exceeds +\/- 99 trillion.":["Sis\u00e4inen raja saavutettu. Saldo ylitt\u00e4\u00e4 +\/- 99 biljoonaa."],"YTD":["KHT"],"Running Totals":["Juoksevat summat"],"Normal":["Normaali"],"Your Personalized Loan Schedule":["Henkil\u00f6kohtainen lainaaikataulusi"],"Last payment amount decreased by":["Viimeisen maksuer\u00e4n summaa v\u00e4hennettiin"],"due to rounding":["py\u00f6rist\u00e4misest\u00e4 johtuen"],"Last payment amount increased by":["Viimeisen maksun summa kasvoi"],"Loan Summary":["Lainayhteenveto"],"Loan Amount":["Lainasumma"],"Number of Payments":["Maksujen lukum\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4"],"Annual Interest Rate":["Vuotuinen korkoprosentti"],"Periodic Payment":["Jaksottainen maksu"],"Loan Date":["Lainan p\u00e4iv\u00e4m\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4"],"1st Payment Due":["Ensimm\u00e4inen maksup\u00e4iv\u00e4"],"Payment Frequency":["Maksutiheys"],"Last Payment Due":["Viimeinen maksup\u00e4iv\u00e4"],"Total Interest Due":["Korkojen kokonaism\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4"],"Total All Payments":["Kaikki maksut yhteens\u00e4"],"Payment Schedule":["Maksuaikataulu"],"Year":["Vuosi"],"Date":["P\u00e4iv\u00e4m\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4"],"Payment":["Maksu"],"Interest":["Korko"],"Principal":["P\u00e4\u00e4oma"],"Balance":["Saldo"],"Calculation method: Normal":["Laskentamenetelm\u00e4: Normaali"],"Total Principal":["Kokonaisp\u00e4\u00e4oma"],"Total Interest":["Kokonaiskorko"],"Pct. of Total Payments":["Kokonaismaksujen %"],"Annual Principal and Interest Totals":["Vuotuiset p\u00e4\u00e4oma- ja korkosummat"],"Accumulated Principal and Interest with Remaining Balance":["Kertyneet p\u00e4\u00e4oma- ja korkosummat sek\u00e4 j\u00e4ljell\u00e4 oleva saldo"],"Total Principal and Interest":["Kokonaisp\u00e4\u00e4oma ja korko"],"Loan":["Laina"],"There are too many unknown values.":["Tuntemattomia arvoja on liikaa."],"Enter \"Loan Amount\", \"Number of Payments\" and \"Annual Interest Rate\".":["Sy\u00f6t\u00e4 \"Lainasumma\", \"Maksujen lukum\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4\" ja \"Vuosikorko\"."],"<strong>Loan Calculator Help...<\/strong>":["<strong>Lainalaskuri ohje...<\/strong>"],"<p>Using the calculator is straightforward. User enters a &quot;loan amount&quot;, &quot;number of months&quot;, &quot;annual interest rate&quot;. The calculator calculates the monthly payment amount.<\/p>":["<p>Laskimen k\u00e4ytt\u00f6 on yksinkertaista. K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 sy\u00f6tt\u00e4\u00e4 &quot;lainasumman&quot;, &quot;kuukausien lukum\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4n&quot;, &quot;vuosikoron&quot;. Laskuri laskee kuukausittaisen maksuer\u00e4n.<\/p>"],"<p>The &quot;Payment Method&quot; determines when the first payment is due. With the default selection, &quot;End-of-Period&quot;, the first payment will be due one month after the loan is made. If &quot;Start-of-Period&quot; is selected, then the first payment will be due on the loan date.<\/p>":["<p>\"Maksun ajoitus\" m\u00e4\u00e4ritt\u00e4\u00e4, milloin ensimm\u00e4inen maksu er\u00e4\u00e4ntyy. Oletusvalinnalla &quot;Jakson lopussa&quot; ensimm\u00e4inen maksu er\u00e4\u00e4ntyy yksi kuukausi lainan my\u00f6nt\u00e4misen j\u00e4lkeen. Jos valitaan &quot;Jakson alussa&quot;, ensimm\u00e4inen maksu er\u00e4\u00e4ntyy lainanottop\u00e4iv\u00e4n\u00e4.<\/p>"],"<p class=\"tail\">The term (duration) of the loan is expressed as a number of months.<\/p>":["<p class=\"tail\">Lainan kesto ilmoitetaan kuukausien lukum\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4n\u00e4.<\/p>"],"<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 months = &nbsp;5 years<\/li><li>120 months = 10 years<\/li><li>180 months = 15 years<\/li><li>240 months = 20 years<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 months = 30 years<\/li><\/ul>":["<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 kuukautta = &nbsp;5 vuotta<\/li><li>120 kuukautta = 10 vuotta<\/li><li>180 kuukautta = 15 vuotta<\/li><li>240 kuukautta = 20 vuotta<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 kuukautta = 30 vuotta<\/li><\/ul>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Need more options including the ability to solve for other unknowns? Set the dates? Set or change the payment and compounding frequencies? Print the schedule? Export to MS Word&trade; (.docx) or MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) files? Please visit, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Tarvitsetko lis\u00e4\u00e4 vaihtoehtoja, kuten mahdollisuuden ratkaista muita tuntemattomia? Asettaa p\u00e4iv\u00e4m\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4t? Asettaa tai muuttaa maksujen ja korkojaksojen tiheytt\u00e4? Tulostaa maksusuunnitelman? Vied\u00e4 MS Word&trade; (.docx) tai MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) tiedostoihin? Vieraile osoitteessa, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Dates must be the first of the month.":["P\u00e4iv\u00e4m\u00e4\u00e4rien on oltava kuukauden ensimm\u00e4isi\u00e4 p\u00e4ivi\u00e4."],"An invalid JavaScript date object.":["Virheellinen JavaScript-p\u00e4iv\u00e4m\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4objekti."],"Monthly":["Kuukausittainen"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Need more options including the ability to solve for other unknowns? Set the dates? Set or change the payment and compounding frequencies? Print the charts? Export to MS Word&trade; (.docx) or MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) files? Please visit, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Tarvitsetko lis\u00e4\u00e4 vaihtoehtoja, kuten mahdollisuuden ratkaista muita tuntemattomia? Asettaa p\u00e4iv\u00e4m\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4t? Asettaa tai muuttaa maksujen ja korkojaksojen tiheytt\u00e4? Tulostaa kaaviot? Vied\u00e4 MS Word&trade; (.docx) tai MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) tiedostoihin? Vieraile osoitteessa, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Prepared for":["Kenelle valmistettu"],"Address":["Osoite"],"City, State  ZIP":["Kaupunki, Maakunta  Postinumero"],"Prepared On":["Laadittu"],"Prepared by":["Valmistajan nimi"],"Phone":["Puhelin"],"Email":["S\u00e4hk\u00f6posti"],"Website":["Verkkosivusto"]}}}